{"config":{"lang":["en"],"separator":"[\\s\\-]+","pipeline":["stopWordFilter"],"fields":{"title":{"boost":1000.0},"text":{"boost":1.0},"tags":{"boost":1000000.0}}},"docs":[{"location":"","title":"Home","text":"Commands Plus Plus      Minecraft Bedrock Command Extension Addon"},{"location":"#welcome-to-the-commands-wiki","title":"Welcome to The Commands++ Wiki","text":"<p>The wiki is here to help out on Commands++ usage, as some commands can be more complex. It will include information, usage examples and tips on how to improve perfomance</p>"},{"location":"#contributing","title":"Contributing","text":"<p>We welcome contributions. If you have a suggestion or found a bug, please open an issue on our GitHub page. If you know how to code you can gladly open a pull request. Full AI code is discouraged and will likely be denied</p> <p>More info on how to run the wiki locally under the wiki README.md</p>"},{"location":"attributes/","title":"Attributes","text":""},{"location":"commands/","title":"Commands","text":""},{"location":"commands/attribute/bindattribute/","title":"Bindattribute","text":"<p>Bind an attribute to a score</p>"},{"location":"commands/attribute/bindattribute/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/bindattribute &lt;bindtype: Enum&gt;,&lt;scoreboardId: String&gt;\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/attribute/bindattribute/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/attribute/getattribute/","title":"Getattribute","text":"<p>One time getter for attributes</p>"},{"location":"commands/attribute/getattribute/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/getattribute &lt;bindtype: Enum&gt;,&lt;scoreboardId: String&gt;\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/attribute/getattribute/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/attribute/unbindattribute/","title":"Unbindattribute","text":"<p>Unbind an attribute</p>"},{"location":"commands/attribute/unbindattribute/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/unbindattribute &lt;bindtype: Enum&gt;\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/attribute/unbindattribute/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/block/block/","title":"Block","text":"<p>Places a block at the current position</p>"},{"location":"commands/block/block/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/block [blockType: Block]\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/block/block/#aliases","title":"Aliases:","text":"<p><code>/b</code></p>"},{"location":"commands/block/block/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operator</p>"},{"location":"commands/block/blockstates/","title":"Blockstates","text":"<p>Lists all block states for either the block being viewed or the block at the specified position</p>"},{"location":"commands/block/blockstates/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/blockstates [position: Location]\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/block/blockstates/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operator</p>"},{"location":"commands/block/blockstatesid/","title":"Blockstatesid","text":"<p>Lists all default block state values for the provided block</p>"},{"location":"commands/block/blockstatesid/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/blockstatesid &lt;blockId: Block&gt;\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/block/blockstatesid/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operator</p>"},{"location":"commands/command/delay/","title":"Delay","text":"<p>Delays the execution of a command</p>"},{"location":"commands/command/delay/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/delay &lt;id: String&gt;,&lt;delayInTicks: Integer&gt;,&lt;command: String&gt;\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/command/delay/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/command/scoremath/","title":"Scoremath","text":"<p>Performs a calculation with the selected operation between the scores of two targets</p>"},{"location":"commands/command/scoremath/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/scoremath &lt;targets: Entity&gt;,&lt;targetObjective: String&gt;,&lt;operation: Enum&gt;,[selectors: Entity],[objective: String]\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/command/scoremath/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/command/scorerandom/","title":"Scorerandom","text":"<p>Outputs a random score value to the target objective, optionally between a min and max value</p>"},{"location":"commands/command/scorerandom/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/scorerandom &lt;targets: Entity&gt;,&lt;targetObjective: String&gt;,[min: Integer],[max: Integer]\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/command/scorerandom/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/debug/benchmarkend/","title":"Benchmarkend","text":"<p>Logs and saves the time since the benchmark started in milliseconds</p>"},{"location":"commands/debug/benchmarkend/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/benchmarkend &lt;startId: String&gt;,[logType: Enum],[fakeplayer: String],[objective: String]\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/debug/benchmarkend/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/debug/benchmarkstart/","title":"Benchmarkstart","text":"<p>Creates a time checkpoint used to find the time commands have taken to run using /benchmarkend</p>"},{"location":"commands/debug/benchmarkstart/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/benchmarkstart &lt;id: String&gt;\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/debug/benchmarkstart/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/debug/biome/","title":"Biome","text":"<p>Outputs the data for the biome based on the position of the executor</p>"},{"location":"commands/debug/biome/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/biome [biomeData: Enum]\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/debug/biome/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/debug/log/","title":"Log","text":"<p>Logs a message to the content log console if enabled in the user's Creator settings</p>"},{"location":"commands/debug/log/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/log &lt;logType: Enum&gt;,&lt;message: String&gt;\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/debug/log/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/debug/seed/","title":"Seed","text":"<p>Returns a message to the executor containing the world seed</p>"},{"location":"commands/debug/seed/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/seed\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/debug/seed/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/debug/test/","title":"Test","text":"<p>Provides an output message in chat if the command has ran successfully</p>"},{"location":"commands/debug/test/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/test\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/debug/test/#aliases","title":"Aliases:","text":"<p><code>/t</code></p>"},{"location":"commands/debug/test/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/dimension/dimension/","title":"Dimension","text":"<p>Teleport between dimensions</p>"},{"location":"commands/dimension/dimension/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/dimension &lt;dimension: Enum&gt;,[targets: Entity]\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/dimension/dimension/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/dimension/explode/","title":"Explode","text":"<p>Creates an explosion at the target position with the provided parameters</p>"},{"location":"commands/dimension/explode/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/explode &lt;location: Location&gt;,[radius: Float],[breaksBlocks: Boolean],[causesFire: Boolean],[allowUnderwater: Boolean],[explosionSource: Entity]\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/dimension/explode/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/draw/","title":"Draw","text":"<p>Draws a group of shapes under a given id</p>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/draw/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/draw &lt;id: String&gt;\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/draw/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/drawarrow/","title":"Drawarrow","text":"<p>Draws a arrow via the Debug Drawer module</p>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/drawarrow/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/drawarrow &lt;id: String&gt;,&lt;startPos: Location&gt;,&lt;endPos: Location&gt;,&lt;headLength: Float&gt;,&lt;headRadius: Float&gt;,&lt;headSegments: Integer&gt;\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/drawarrow/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/drawbox/","title":"Drawbox","text":"<p>Draws a box via the Debug Drawer module</p>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/drawbox/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/drawbox &lt;id: String&gt;,&lt;position: Location&gt;,&lt;bound: Location&gt;,&lt;scale: Float&gt;\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/drawbox/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/drawcircle/","title":"Drawcircle","text":"<p>Draws a circle via the Debug Drawer module</p>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/drawcircle/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/drawcircle &lt;id: String&gt;,&lt;position: Location&gt;,&lt;scale: Float&gt;\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/drawcircle/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/drawcone/","title":"Drawcone","text":"<p>Draws a cone via the Debug Drawer module</p>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/drawcone/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/drawcone &lt;id: String&gt;,&lt;position: Location&gt;,&lt;height: Float&gt;,&lt;radii: Float&gt;,&lt;scale: Float&gt;\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/drawcone/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/drawcylinder/","title":"Drawcylinder","text":"<p>Draws a cylinder via the Debug Drawer module</p>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/drawcylinder/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/drawcylinder &lt;id: String&gt;,&lt;position: Location&gt;,&lt;height: Float&gt;,&lt;radiiBottom: Float&gt;,&lt;radiiTop: Float&gt;,&lt;scale: Float&gt;,&lt;numSegments: Integer&gt;\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/drawcylinder/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/drawellipsoid/","title":"Drawellipsoid","text":"<p>Draws a ellipsoid via the Debug Drawer module</p>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/drawellipsoid/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/drawellipsoid &lt;id: String&gt;,&lt;position: Location&gt;,&lt;radii: Float&gt;,&lt;scale: Float&gt;,&lt;segmentsPerAxis: Integer&gt;\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/drawellipsoid/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/drawline/","title":"Drawline","text":"<p>Add a line</p>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/drawline/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/drawline &lt;id: String&gt;,&lt;startPos: Location&gt;,&lt;endPos: Location&gt;\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/drawline/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/drawpyramid/","title":"Drawpyramid","text":"<p>Draws a pyramid via the Debug Drawer module</p>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/drawpyramid/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/drawpyramid &lt;id: String&gt;,&lt;position: Location&gt;,&lt;height: Float&gt;,&lt;width: Float&gt;,&lt;depth: Float&gt;,&lt;scale: Float&gt;\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/drawpyramid/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/drawremove/","title":"Drawremove","text":"<p>Undraws and removes a group of shapes permanently</p>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/drawremove/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/drawremove &lt;id: String&gt;\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/drawremove/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/drawremoveall/","title":"Drawremoveall","text":"<p>Undraws and removes all shapes permanently</p>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/drawremoveall/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/drawremoveall\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/drawremoveall/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/drawsphere/","title":"Drawsphere","text":"<p>Draws a sphere via the Debug Drawer module</p>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/drawsphere/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/drawsphere &lt;id: String&gt;,&lt;position: Location&gt;,&lt;scale: Float&gt;\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/drawsphere/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/drawtext/","title":"Drawtext","text":"<p>Draws a text via the Debug Drawer module</p>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/drawtext/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/drawtext &lt;id: String&gt;,&lt;location: Location&gt;,&lt;text: String&gt;,&lt;useRotation: Boolean&gt;,&lt;showThroughBlocks: Boolean&gt;,&lt;backfaceVisible: Boolean&gt;,&lt;textBackfaceVisible: Boolean&gt;\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/drawtext/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/drawvolume/","title":"Drawvolume","text":"<p>Draws a box via the Debug Drawer module</p>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/drawvolume/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/drawvolume &lt;id: String&gt;,&lt;startPos: Location&gt;,&lt;endPos: Location&gt;\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/drawvolume/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/getdrawcount/","title":"Getdrawcount","text":"<p>Display how many shapes are currently drawn</p>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/getdrawcount/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/getdrawcount\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/getdrawcount/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/setdrawcolor/","title":"Setdrawcolor","text":"<p>Sets the draw color</p>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/setdrawcolor/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/setdrawcolor &lt;shapeId: String&gt;,&lt;colorRed: Integer&gt;,&lt;colorGreen: Integer&gt;,&lt;colorBlue: Integer&gt;,&lt;alpha: Integer&gt;\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/setdrawcolor/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/setdrawtextbackgroundcolor/","title":"Setdrawtextbackgroundcolor","text":"<p>Sets the draw color for text</p>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/setdrawtextbackgroundcolor/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/setdrawtextbackgroundcolor &lt;shapeId: String&gt;,&lt;colorRed: Integer&gt;,&lt;colorGreen: Integer&gt;,&lt;colorBlue: Integer&gt;,&lt;alpha: Integer&gt;\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/setdrawtextbackgroundcolor/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/undraw/","title":"Undraw","text":"<p>Undraws a group of shapes under a given id, but keeps them in the manager</p>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/undraw/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/undraw &lt;id: String&gt;\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/undraw/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/undrawall/","title":"Undrawall","text":"<p>Undraws all shapes, but keeps the groups in the manager</p>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/undrawall/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/undrawall\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/drawer/undrawall/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/entity/entitycount/","title":"Entitycount","text":"<p>Returns the count of all loaded targets to a fakeplayer's scoreboard objective</p>"},{"location":"commands/entity/entitycount/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/entitycount &lt;targets: Entity&gt;,&lt;fakeplayer: String&gt;,&lt;objective: String&gt;\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/entity/entitycount/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/entity/fmbe/","title":"Fmbe","text":"<p>Animates targets (fox) to appear as a full block when holding a three dimensional block item</p>"},{"location":"commands/entity/fmbe/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/fmbe &lt;entities: Entity&gt;,[fmbeType: Enum]\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/entity/fmbe/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/entity/harm/","title":"Harm","text":"<p>Decreases all targets current health value by an amount</p>"},{"location":"commands/entity/harm/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/harm [target: Player],[value: Integer]\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/entity/harm/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/entity/heal/","title":"Heal","text":"<p>Heals the target by a value</p>"},{"location":"commands/entity/heal/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/heal [target: Player],[value: Integer]\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/entity/heal/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/entity/health/","title":"Health","text":"<p>Modifies all targets health based on the mode and value</p>"},{"location":"commands/entity/health/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/health &lt;target: Player&gt;,&lt;mode: Enum&gt;,&lt;value: Integer&gt;\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/entity/health/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/entity/remove/","title":"Remove","text":"<p>Removes entites from the world</p>"},{"location":"commands/entity/remove/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/remove &lt;targets: Entity&gt;\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/entity/remove/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/entity/rotate/","title":"Rotate","text":"<p>Modifies target entities rotation</p>"},{"location":"commands/entity/rotate/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/rotate [targets: Entity],[rotationX: Float],[rotationY: Float]\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/entity/rotate/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/entity/setonfire/","title":"Setonfire","text":"<p>Sets the target entities on fire</p>"},{"location":"commands/entity/setonfire/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/setonfire &lt;targets: Entity&gt;,[timeSeconds: Float],[useEffects: Boolean]\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/entity/setonfire/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/entity/spawnitem/","title":"Spawnitem","text":"<p>Summons an item entity</p>"},{"location":"commands/entity/spawnitem/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/spawnitem &lt;item: Item&gt;,&lt;location: Location&gt;,[quantity: Integer]\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/entity/spawnitem/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/entity/top/","title":"Top","text":"<p>Teleports the targets to the top most block at their position</p>"},{"location":"commands/entity/top/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/top [targets: Entity],[minHeight: Float]\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/entity/top/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/items/itemdurability/","title":"Itemdurability","text":"<p>Modifies the durability of the item at the provided location within an entity's inventory</p>"},{"location":"commands/items/itemdurability/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/itemdurability &lt;targets: Player&gt;,&lt;slot: Enum&gt;,&lt;index: Integer&gt;,&lt;mode: Enum&gt;,&lt;value: Integer&gt;\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/items/itemdurability/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command BlocksMoves an item from one provided location within an entity's inventory to another</p>"},{"location":"commands/items/itemdurability/#syntax_1","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/itemdurability &lt;targets: Player&gt;,&lt;slot: Enum&gt;,&lt;index: Integer&gt;,&lt;destinationSlot: Enum&gt;,&lt;destinationIndex: Integer&gt;,[moveMode: Enum]\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/items/itemdurability/#permission_1","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/items/itemname/","title":"Itemname","text":"<p>Enchants the item at the provided location within an entity's inventory</p>"},{"location":"commands/items/itemname/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/itemname &lt;targets: Player&gt;,&lt;slot: Enum&gt;,&lt;index: Integer&gt;,&lt;enchant: String&gt;,[level: Integer]\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/items/itemname/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command BlocksRenames the item at the provided location within an entity's inventory</p>"},{"location":"commands/items/itemname/#syntax_1","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/itemname &lt;targets: Player&gt;,&lt;slot: Enum&gt;,&lt;index: Integer&gt;,&lt;name: String&gt;\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/items/itemname/#permission_1","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/misc/credits/","title":"Credits","text":"<p>Provides an output message in chat containing the credits for Commands++</p>"},{"location":"commands/misc/credits/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/credits\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/misc/credits/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Everyone</p>"},{"location":"commands/misc/gamerulesetup/","title":"Gamerulesetup","text":"<p>Sets most gamerules to game-ready optimised values</p>"},{"location":"commands/misc/gamerulesetup/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/gamerulesetup\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/misc/gamerulesetup/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operators and Command Blocks</p>"},{"location":"commands/misc/guide/","title":"Guide","text":"<p>Lists in chat all new commands added by Commands++</p>"},{"location":"commands/misc/guide/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/guide [page: Integer]\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/misc/guide/#aliases","title":"Aliases:","text":"<p><code>/listcommands</code></p>"},{"location":"commands/misc/guide/#permission","title":"Permission:","text":"<p>Operator</p>"},{"location":"commands/misc/rules/","title":"Rules","text":"<p>Outputs to chat the world specific rules</p>"},{"location":"commands/misc/rules/#syntax","title":"Syntax:","text":"<pre><code>/rules [line: Integer]\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"commands/misc/rules/#permission"